[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_06]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_06_desc]
“In fact, all the names of the national policies in Cloudsdale are muffins just because I want to confuse those players who are peeking at which national focus we are clicking.”\n§g“Players? Did you just break the fourth wall?”§!\n“The Fourth wall? What is that, is it delicious? Is it more delicious than muffins?”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_06_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about independence or not (again), but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_06]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_06_desc]
“事实上，云中城所有国策的名字都是马芬的原因，是为了让那些偷看我们在点哪个国策的玩家们感到困惑。”\n§g“玩家？你是不是刚刚打破了第四面墙？”§!\n“第四面墙？那是什么，好吃吗？比马芬更好吃吗？”

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_06_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄又在思考关于独立与否的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

